# The format corpus is deliberately *not* in git-lfs, unlike the regression
# corpus binaries the root .gitattributes routes there.
#
# These are a couple of kilobytes each and the build fails without them. Behind
# lfs, a clone without the filter installed gets pointer files instead, and the
# gate then reports that OpenMCAD cannot open its own historical documents --
# which is a true statement about the working tree and a completely misleading
# one about the format. Small files that must be present are worth having in
# the object database.
*.ompart     -filter -diff -merge binary
